  "solution": {
    "text": "The elements present in organic compounds are C, H, S and their oxides are <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively. <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> turns lime water milky, water turns anhydrous copper sulphate blue and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> being reducing agent can reduce <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math> into green coloured <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> compound <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> etc.",
